24
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,170
Did you hear ?

25
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:55,770
Someone is targeted by the Hundred Days Execution Order.

26
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:57,610
He also killed a group of Core Formation cultivators.

27
00:01:57,440 --> 00:02:00,690
I heard ! Even the Grand Elder was killed !

28
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:02,050
This is too sinister...

29
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,570
Is he Nascent Soul ?

30
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:06,890
This is... wait...

31
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,370
It's him !

32
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,770
Run ! Quick !

33
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:30,570
This fiend broke Xue Ming's formation

34
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:32,290
like it was nothing...

35
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,690
If we obey him,

36
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:36,610
we might be able to survive.

37
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:38,730
This person's strength is terrifying.

38
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:41,130
We must be very careful.

39
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:44,890
It seems becoming his disciple was the right choice.

40
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,250
If I follow him,

41
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:48,010
I'll be able to do as I please

42
00:02:47,760 --> 00:02:49,570
in the outer Sea of Devils.

43
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:53,050
I need to establish a foothold in the Sea of Devils

44
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:56,690
and the Fighting Evil Sect is my best choice for that.

45
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:02,410
I used a bit too much of my Ji Realm earlier

46
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:03,890
but it's okay.

47
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:05,530
It should recover quickly

48
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:07,410
if I nourish it within my Sea of Consciousness.

49
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:14,050
He actually did it....

50
00:03:14,640 --> 00:03:16,130
From now on,

51
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:19,530
I am the strongest person below Nascent Soul.

52
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:24,730
When I first met him,

53
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:27,170
I thought he was Sun Youcai.

54
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:29,250
I nearly caused a misunderstanding.

55
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:33,730
Had we really fought back then,

56
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:37,130
he would've slaughtered everyone present.

57
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:42,050
He wouldn't even have shown an ounce of mercy towards me.

58
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:44,130
You don't need to worry.

59
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:46,450
After I'm done with all this,

60
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:48,690
I'll take you back to the Burning Fire Alliance.

61
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:14,450
Fellow cultivator afflicted by the Hundred Days Execution Order,

62
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:17,330
Grand Elder Qian Kun provoked you

63
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:19,450
and killing him was justified.

64
00:04:19,440 --> 00:04:22,850
You already killed dozens of our disciples.

65
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:24,330
However...

66
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:29,170
Do you truly think my Fighting Evil Sect is made of lambs to prey on ?

67
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:34,730
Formation !

68
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:36,090
10 000 cultivators in a formation...

69
00:04:35,840 --> 00:04:41,810
The headquarters of the Fighting Evil Sect has 13 562 members

70
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:44,010
and they're all here !

71
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:47,250
The Great Dragon Formation actually exists !

72
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:57,610
Xie Donglai
Fighting Evil Sect Leader
Late stage Core Formation

73
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:59,610
The Great Dragon Formation is the protection formation of the Fighting Evil Sect.

74
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:02,370
Unless you are a Nascent Soul cultivator,

75
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:03,770
it's impossible to break.

76
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:08,210
The formation isn't fully active yet.

77
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:11,890
My brother and I are Elders of a branch of the sect

78
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:15,890
Please let us negotiate with the Sect Leader for you.

79
00:05:15,880 --> 00:05:17,010
Yes, yes !

80
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:19,730
We can still stop the formation now.

81
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:21,250
Once it's activated,

82
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,610
it will be too late.

83
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:26,090
Are you trying to pull a trick in front of Master ?

84
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:29,090
No need, just take care of Miss Li.

85
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,610
Understood.

86
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:32,850
Senior !

87
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:35,490
Be careful...

88
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:42,490
They need to set up this big formation

89
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:44,170
so it's the perfect time to attack.

90
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:07,530
Formation, activate !

91
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:28,850
His cultivation...

92
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:32,850
went from Late stage to Peak Late stage Core Formation !

93
00:07:33,080 --> 00:07:34,130
Wait,

94
00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:35,690
he's still breaking through !

95
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:36,650
This is...

96
00:07:47,200 --> 00:07:50,690
Xie Donglai
Fighting Evil Sect Leader
False Nascent Soul

97
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:55,050
False Nascent Soul realm...

98
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,450
False Nascent Soul

99
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:58,170
is below Early stage Nascent Soul.

100
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:59,970
But it's infinitely close to Nascent Soul.

101
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,690
The Fighting Evil Sect

102
00:08:01,640 --> 00:08:03,770
doesn't accept traitors.

103
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:05,730
I thought he would win

104
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:07,250
but now the situation has changed...

105
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:08,450
He will lose !

106
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:11,770
He still has my Soul Blood...

107
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:13,330
If he dies,

108
00:08:13,080 --> 00:08:15,090
I will die alongside him !

109
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:17,930
This Great Dragon Formation

110
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:20,010
must have some kind of weakness !

111
00:08:21,400 --> 00:08:22,930
I have heard

112
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:24,450
the rumors about

113
00:08:24,200 --> 00:08:26,370
what you did along the way.

114
00:08:26,400 --> 00:08:29,290
No one below Nascent Soul can beat you.

115
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:33,770
But now, my cultivation is the equivalent of Nascent Soul !

116
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:37,170
Let's see if you can defeat me !

117
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:40,050
This formation...

118
00:08:48,160 --> 00:08:50,210
The Myriad Blood Demon Formation...

119
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:52,250
I know that you broke

120
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:55,610
that traitor Xue Ming's Myriad Blood Demon Formation.

121
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:58,050
But the formation was only

122
00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:01,490
a tenth of the power of the Great Dragon Formation !

123
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:03,610
You've gathered the spiritual energy

124
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:05,610
of 10 000 people on yourself.

125
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:08,250
You just temporarily increased your cultivation.

126
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:12,970
With my cultivation, it will only take an instant

127
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:14,650
to kill you !

128
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:30,250
Since I could break that Myriad Blood Demon Formation,

129
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:32,250
then I can break the Great Dragon Formation too !

130
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,410
You fool.

131
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:43,570
The might of a Nascent Soul

132
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:46,170
is not something a Junior like you can resist !

133
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:49,010
Since it operates like the Myriad Blood Demon Formation...

134
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:51,410
...he just needs to find its core !

135
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:56,650
Mere tricks !

136
00:10:08,920 --> 00:10:10,410
The dragon's head !

137
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:12,850
Splendid !

138
00:10:13,160 --> 00:10:15,610
It's been 100 years

139
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:18,490
since I have seen someone attack the formation !

140
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:23,810
It's time to eat !

141
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:27,010
A... a Nascent Soul cultivator !?

142
00:10:26,920 --> 00:10:29,770
Wang Lin, you damn fiend !

143
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:39,610
Who gave you the audacity to challenge

144
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:41,090
our mighty sect

145
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:43,330
with such little strength ?

146
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:45,050
Mighty sect ?

147
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:47,410
You're too pretentious.

148
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:56,050
What ?

149
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:57,850
What the hell is this thing ?!

150
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:01,810
Grandpa Xu is the first demon of the world !

151
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:08,930
I must kill this monster today

152
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:11,090
in the name of the heavens !

153
00:11:29,400 --> 00:11:32,930
Junior, you're no match for the teleportation

154
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:35,450
of the Nascent Soul level.

155
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:45,650
The formation... isn't broken !?

156
00:11:56,000 --> 00:12:00,090
Did you think that our sect protection formation would break easily ?

157
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:04,250
If this formation is invincible,

158
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:06,170
then if enough people fuel it

159
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:08,730
it might even give Soul Formation level cultivation.

160
00:12:08,880 --> 00:12:10,290
If that's true,

161
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:13,970
why didn't the Fighting Evil Sect invade South Dipper City ?

162
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:17,370
This formation must have a fatal weakness.

163
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:23,370
Could it be...

164
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:25,250
Neither you or your friends

165
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:27,930
will be able to escape !

166
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:29,570
Kill them !

167
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:40,530
Go ahead and try !

168
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:46,450
That old ghost Xie Donglai

169
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:47,650
is playing dirty !

170
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:18,330
That's good...

171
00:13:18,120 --> 00:13:19,570
If she gets injured,

172
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:21,410
I probably won't live either.

173
00:13:31,680 --> 00:13:34,770
It's not that easy to break my golden bowl !

174
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:02,450
The Fighting Evil Sect is lacking females.

175
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:03,650
From now on,

176
00:14:03,800 --> 00:14:05,850
you belong to me !

177
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:07,810
You...

178
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:09,770
can die.

179
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:22,050
Senior !

180
00:14:22,880 --> 00:14:24,970
Senior Brother, you're injured...

181
00:14:25,280 --> 00:14:29,210
Master, fighting a Nascent Soul as a Core Formation

182
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:30,730
isn't possible.

183
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:32,530
We should retreat for now.

184
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:35,130
This Great Dragon Formation can't be broken by Core Formation cultivators.

185
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:37,330
We really should retreat.

186
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:43,570
Am I going to die here ?

187
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:45,890
Help ! Help me !

188
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:53,850
We won't retreat.

189
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:04,730
Be reasonable and give me your Golden Cores now.

190
00:15:04,520 --> 00:15:07,450
If you don't, none of you will survive !

191
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:30,850
He can't hold on !

192
00:15:43,560 --> 00:15:45,610
Are they the same strength now ?

193
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:47,170
Xie Donglai is retreating !

194
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:49,010
Could he already be tired ?

195
00:16:07,520 --> 00:16:09,570
And now he's stronger...

196
00:16:18,040 --> 00:16:21,210
This is the end of this battle !

197
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:23,530
No !

198
00:16:23,440 --> 00:16:25,170
One last test.

199
00:16:34,520 --> 00:16:36,090
Just as I thought.

200
00:16:43,640 --> 00:16:44,930
Senior !

201
00:16:44,160 --> 00:16:44,930
Master !

202
00:16:44,880 --> 00:16:46,370
Are you alright ?

203
00:16:46,960 --> 00:16:51,090
I found the way to beat the Great Dragon Formation.

204
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:20,690
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

205
00:15:20,440 --> 00:15:23,570
I will let the world refine my soul.

206
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:26,450
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

207
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:29,330
I will fight.

208
00:15:29,080 --> 00:15:32,210
I'll break through the abyss of despair

209
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:35,090
to finally learn who I really am.

210
00:15:34,840 --> 00:15:37,970
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

211
00:15:37,720 --> 00:15:40,850
I embrace this obsession.

212
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:44,050
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

213
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:46,810
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

214
00:15:47,160 --> 00:15:49,570
